      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- network is tcp4 or tcp6\n- addr.Unmap() first: ::ffff:169.254.169.254 is IPv4\n- global unicast and not private: drops loopback,\n  link-local (metadata), RFC 1918, multicast, 0.0.0.0\n- not in extra ranges: 0.0.0.0/8, 100.64.0.0/10 (CGNAT),\n  198.18.0.0/15, 240.0.0.0/4, 64:ff9b::/96 (NAT64)\n- port 443 only",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- network is tcp4 or tcp6\n- addr.Unmap() first: ::ffff:169.254.169.254 is IPv4\n- global unicast and not private: drops loopback,\n  link-local (metadata), RFC 1918, multicast, 0.0.0.0\n- not in extra ranges: 0.0.0.0/8, 100.64.0.0/10 (CGNAT),\n  198.18.0.0/15, 240.0.0.0/4, 64:ff9b::/96 (NAT64)\n- port 443 only",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
