      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- every IP of a name (Happy Eyeballs tries IPv4\n  and IPv6 in parallel)\n- every retry and every redirect\n- an IP written straight into the URL (no DNS step,\n  but it still goes through Control)\n\nKeep-alive reuse skips the dial: fine, that connection\nwas checked when it was opened.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
